  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Indonesia Infrastructure and Finance Compact - Advancing Transport and Logistics Accessibility Services (ATLAS) Project - Infrastructure Investment Activity: the Good Practice Infrastructure Projects Activity: This activity aims to support five infrastructure projects, which are intended to demonstrate innovative and strengthened approaches to project preparation, structuring and financing, and procurement and implementation, so that subnational governments endorse and promote Public Investment Management Guidelines principles.</narrative>
